WEBVTT

00:03.510 --> 00:04.900
The rice is done!

00:05.440 --> 00:07.160
The miso soup is okay, too.

00:08.800 --> 00:10.780
Doesn't it smell nice?

00:12.840 --> 00:14.450
It's gonna taste great!

00:14.860 --> 00:16.280
Hot, hot!

00:17.660 --> 00:20.650
You're supposed to do it after you wet your hands.

00:20.650 --> 00:24.330
Oh~! This apron came in handy again.

00:24.330 --> 00:27.540
Or rather, this is the right way to use them.

00:27.540 --> 00:29.340
That's right.

00:29.340 --> 00:33.550
Subarun was so surprised back then.

00:34.510 --> 00:36.640
Welcome home, darling!

00:40.810 --> 00:45.980
If I remember correctly, it was Saki's idea to welcome Subarun with the swimsuit-apron outfit, right?

00:45.980 --> 00:47.620
I had so much confidence in it...

00:47.620 --> 00:49.530
What was wrong with it?

00:49.530 --> 00:55.110
Even Ice Age, the class president, completely fails in capturing boys' hearts.

00:55.990 --> 00:59.050
I don't want to hear that from
someone who can't even make onigiri!

00:59.050 --> 01:00.510
That's got nothing to do with it!

01:00.510 --> 01:02.910
I'm going to call Subarun in.

01:03.810 --> 01:05.080
Subarun!

01:05.080 --> 01:07.960
It's time for lunch.

01:16.970 --> 01:20.300
Don't give up and do your best

01:20.300 --> 01:23.680
Try your luck and fight! Chin-up!

01:23.680 --> 01:26.730
I know perfectly

01:26.730 --> 01:30.400
How weak a person is on their own

01:30.610 --> 01:33.570
Things that are on the verge of being lost

01:33.570 --> 01:37.240
I hold them close to my chest

01:37.240 --> 01:40.200
Your gentle words

01:40.200 --> 01:44.160
Caress my cheeks

01:44.160 --> 01:47.210
The irritation that has been building up

01:47.210 --> 01:50.000
From wanting to reach the goal

01:50.000 --> 01:54.170
My heart that almost wants to burst out crying

01:54.170 --> 01:57.760
The place that warms it up

01:57.760 --> 02:00.680
Even if we have to go through the pain

02:00.680 --> 02:04.180
We have to protect this

02:04.180 --> 02:05.640
We're unripe fighters!

02:05.640 --> 02:07.560
We won't lose now

02:07.560 --> 02:10.940
We will raise our small hands up in the air

02:10.940 --> 02:14.360
Take in that vital power, embrace it

02:14.360 --> 02:17.820
Then release it towards the sky!

02:17.820 --> 02:19.360
The courage that cannot be stopped

02:19.360 --> 02:21.200
jump and shoot

02:19.360 --> 02:21.200
Tomorrow we'll jump and shoot!

02:21.200 --> 02:24.120
I will pass the ball to you

02:24.120 --> 02:28.410
The memories that are awoken by our calls

02:28.410 --> 02:31.960
Game

02:28.410 --> 02:31.960
Will move the game along

02:38.550 --> 02:41.930
Start a Hardcore Fire

02:47.730 --> 02:50.640
I was set up by Miho-nee again...

02:53.360 --> 02:54.650
Training camp?

02:54.650 --> 02:56.900
It's for the school basketball tournament.

02:56.900 --> 02:58.240
Basketball tournament?

02:58.240 --> 03:02.490
Those girls are the representatives for our class, 6-C.

03:02.490 --> 03:05.330
So you want me to help them do some special training at a training camp?

03:05.830 --> 03:07.040
You've got time anyway, right?

03:07.540 --> 03:09.250
Don't just decide that on your own.

03:09.250 --> 03:13.790
Those girls will be disappointed when they hear it's going to be cancelled.

03:13.790 --> 03:18.090
They were so happy when I told them about it during lunch.

03:21.470 --> 03:23.890
As I thought, you can't refuse, right?

03:25.010 --> 03:26.510
You're a devil...

03:27.930 --> 03:32.440
Since I accepted that proposal, I want to help them win.

03:32.440 --> 03:34.060
Subarun!

03:34.060 --> 03:36.150
It's time for lunch!

03:36.150 --> 03:38.190
Sorry for letting you guys handle all the work.

03:38.190 --> 03:39.490
It's fine, it's fine.

03:39.490 --> 03:42.030
It's just onigiri and miso soup anyway.

03:42.030 --> 03:43.950
That's more than enough.

03:43.950 --> 03:46.410
Then let's go, darling.

03:46.910 --> 03:48.990
Let's eat!

03:49.540 --> 03:52.160
Everyone helped make the food.

03:54.540 --> 03:56.710
That onigiri was made by Tomoka.

03:57.380 --> 03:58.550
Tomoka made it?

03:59.000 --> 04:01.130
Um, please go ahead.

04:01.130 --> 04:03.590
Okay, then.

04:04.430 --> 04:06.680
Hina made this.

04:06.680 --> 04:08.970
I made this.

04:09.600 --> 04:11.230
You can eat mine, too.

04:16.560 --> 04:18.730
As expected, this is pretty hard on my stomach...

04:19.360 --> 04:22.650
Mine is a super big onigiri. Service version!

04:28.160 --> 04:29.370
How does it taste?

04:29.370 --> 04:32.580
The amount of stock is just right. It tastes good.

04:32.580 --> 04:34.000
Really?

04:34.000 --> 04:35.540
Did Saki make this?

04:35.540 --> 04:36.580
Yes.

04:36.580 --> 04:39.380
Saki will be a good wife when she grows up.

04:44.510 --> 04:46.930
Everyone will be good wives when they grow up!

04:46.930 --> 04:47.970
Yeah, everyone will!

04:47.970 --> 04:49.430
I think everyone will!

04:52.430 --> 04:54.560
Let's practice in the gym during the afternoon.

04:54.560 --> 04:55.440
Yes!

04:55.440 --> 04:57.190
Train us well, Subaru!

04:57.190 --> 04:59.360
We don't want to lose to Class D, after all.

04:59.860 --> 05:01.030
Class D?

05:01.030 --> 05:04.200
The boys' basketball club is mostly made up of people from Class D.

05:04.200 --> 05:06.320
The tournament is open to both boys and girls, so...

05:06.320 --> 05:08.870
In other words, it'll end up being another match with the boys' basketball club?

05:10.740 --> 05:14.960
That reminds me, weren't you all in the
same class as Takenaka from the boys' club?

05:17.290 --> 05:18.420
Yes...

05:21.420 --> 05:24.880
You'll win if you manage to get him to team up with you guys, right?

05:24.880 --> 05:26.340
Ah, well...

05:26.340 --> 05:28.050
Um...

05:28.430 --> 05:30.300
He isn't participating.

05:31.220 --> 05:34.000
Takenaka-kun decided to enter the soccer tournament,

05:34.000 --> 05:35.980
so he won't be playing basketball.

05:35.980 --> 05:36.890
Soccer?

05:36.890 --> 05:38.810
Isn't Takenaka the captain of the boys' basketball team?

05:38.810 --> 05:40.650
Well, that's true, but...

05:42.730 --> 05:48.240
Natsuhi- Takenaka said he wouldn't play basketball with Maho no matter what.

05:48.240 --> 05:49.240
He won't play with Maho?

05:49.240 --> 05:51.200
Why would he say something like that?

05:52.160 --> 05:55.910
Even without him, we can still win!

06:05.840 --> 06:10.010
Since it's a training camp, we can
train all the way into the evening!

06:10.010 --> 06:11.300
Oh~!

06:11.300 --> 06:14.770
Hina is the worst at basketball, so I'll try my best!

06:14.770 --> 06:16.770
Let's all try our best together!

06:29.990 --> 06:31.870
Natsuhi!

06:36.580 --> 06:38.580
Why are you here?!

06:38.580 --> 06:39.420
Shut up.

06:39.420 --> 06:41.210
It's got nothing to do with you.

06:41.210 --> 06:42.080
What?!

06:44.550 --> 06:46.090
Hasegawa-san!

06:46.510 --> 06:47.510
What's the matter, Saki?

06:47.510 --> 06:48.760
There's trouble!

06:48.760 --> 06:50.010
Please come immediately!

06:50.010 --> 06:50.630
Hey!

06:55.260 --> 06:56.720
What do you want?!

06:55.680 --> 06:56.720
Isn't that...

06:57.140 --> 06:58.520
...Takenaka?

06:58.930 --> 07:00.140
Why is he here?

07:00.140 --> 07:01.810
You bastard!

07:01.810 --> 07:03.480
Why you!

07:07.280 --> 07:08.860
We have to stop them right now!

07:08.860 --> 07:12.620
Even if you try to stop them, those two won't listen to you at all...

07:12.950 --> 07:14.120
Natsuhi!

07:14.120 --> 07:15.870
I'll settle this once and for all today!

07:15.870 --> 07:18.200
That's my line!

07:19.960 --> 07:21.620
All right, stop right there!

07:24.170 --> 07:25.790
You entered the basketball tournament?

07:25.790 --> 07:26.710
That's right.

07:26.710 --> 07:30.420
Weren't you going to play soccer because you didn't want to play with me?!

07:30.420 --> 07:33.590
The teacher put me into basketball by mistake!

07:34.090 --> 07:35.350
By mistake?

07:35.350 --> 07:40.600
She said that everyone who entered the basketball tournament had to go on a training camp,

07:40.600 --> 07:42.190
so I made a special effort to come down.

07:47.820 --> 07:48.820
Oh~!

07:48.820 --> 07:50.150
I missed...

07:59.450 --> 08:01.040
What's the meaning of this?

08:01.040 --> 08:02.250
Oh, sorry.

08:02.250 --> 08:03.710
I forgot to tell you.

08:03.710 --> 08:06.250
There's one more member taking part in the training camp.

08:06.250 --> 08:07.590
Takenaka Natsuhi.

08:07.590 --> 08:08.250
Over!

08:09.090 --> 08:12.340
You knew Takenaka and Maho weren't on good terms, right?

08:13.260 --> 08:16.720
He couldn't refuse the idea.

08:16.720 --> 08:22.640
I put him in basketball by mistake, but when I asked him if he minded,

08:22.640 --> 08:27.860
he said, "I don't really mind", and, "It's not that I don't want to take part in the training camp."

08:27.860 --> 08:29.110
"Not that I don't want to"?

08:29.110 --> 08:30.280
Aren't he and Maho...

08:30.820 --> 08:36.120
Basically, basketball is a lot more important to him than his conflict with Maho.

08:36.120 --> 08:38.410
I just took advantage of that.

08:38.410 --> 08:39.910
So you tested it out?

08:39.910 --> 08:41.950
You have a nice personality, as usual.

08:42.540 --> 08:44.370
But what are you going to do about Maho?

08:44.370 --> 08:47.630
Well, there's nothing I can do.

08:47.630 --> 08:48.710
You can't?

08:48.710 --> 08:53.630
If I stepped in and told them to stop arguing, I'm sure they would stop straight away.

08:53.970 --> 08:55.300
Isn't that what we want?

08:55.300 --> 08:56.970
I'm telling you, you shouldn't do something like that.

08:56.970 --> 09:02.520
They're no longer so innocent that they'll make up just because they stop arguing.

09:02.520 --> 09:03.310
Wait a second.

09:03.310 --> 09:06.480
I don't mind coaching basketball, but telling me to mediate an argument...

09:06.480 --> 09:07.560
Idiot.

09:07.560 --> 09:11.480
Did you think I would leave those delicate matters to you?

09:11.860 --> 09:15.240
Did you really have to insult me like that?

09:23.200 --> 09:24.120
Oh...

09:28.880 --> 09:31.590
Oh~, Takenaka!

09:32.420 --> 09:33.960
Pass~!

09:33.960 --> 09:36.130
Geez, can you catch the ball properly?

09:36.470 --> 09:37.220
Feh~

09:37.220 --> 09:38.340
Of course I can!

09:39.640 --> 09:40.510
Here.

09:40.510 --> 09:41.470
Yes~!

09:41.470 --> 09:42.810
Nice pass.

09:45.810 --> 09:46.640
What is it?

09:46.640 --> 09:50.060
Since you already made the effort to come down for the camp, why not practise together?

09:50.060 --> 09:50.810
Huh?

09:50.810 --> 09:53.230
I thought you were just being creepy,
staying with the girls' basketball club.

09:53.230 --> 09:54.900
So you're actually acting like a coach?

09:54.900 --> 09:56.570
Get caught already, you lolicon bastard.

10:00.280 --> 10:01.330
Subarun!

10:01.330 --> 10:03.080
You should leave that idiot alone!

10:03.080 --> 10:04.500
Shut up, Maho, you idiot!

10:04.500 --> 10:07.620
Try saying that one more time, you bastard!

10:07.620 --> 10:08.920
Calm down, Maho!

10:08.920 --> 10:11.540
What do you mean by "idiot"?!

10:09.420 --> 10:11.540
What happened between you and Maho?

10:11.540 --> 10:12.920
Nothing.

10:12.090 --> 10:13.800
Let me go!

10:12.920 --> 10:14.800
I have nothing to do with her.

10:14.800 --> 10:17.470
If you're so against it, just go home, you idiot!

10:17.470 --> 10:18.930
Shut up, idiot!

10:18.930 --> 10:20.890
Maho's right.

10:18.930 --> 10:20.220
What was that, you bastard?!

10:20.220 --> 10:21.970
Try saying that again!

10:21.430 --> 10:24.090
If you didn't want to take part in the camp and...

10:21.970 --> 10:24.090
People who call people idiots are the real idiots!

10:24.090 --> 10:27.390
...the basketball tournament, you
could have just turned it down, right?

10:27.390 --> 10:29.190
Don't misunderstand.

10:29.190 --> 10:32.730
I think it's a lot better having you here.

10:32.730 --> 10:34.230
I'm trying to tell you that's not the case!

10:35.730 --> 10:40.700
Even with Minato, these guys won't be able to beat 6-D without me.

10:40.700 --> 10:41.780
Don't mess with us!

10:41.780 --> 10:44.030
Even without Natsuhi, we'd still win!

10:47.620 --> 10:49.580
Natsuhi...!

10:50.620 --> 10:51.630
Takenaka.

10:52.920 --> 10:54.290
I'm going for a run.

10:54.290 --> 10:56.800
I'll be here until the end of the camp,

10:56.800 --> 10:59.260
but I won't be practising with you guys.

10:59.260 --> 11:00.930
Wait up, Natsuhi!

11:01.550 --> 11:04.390
We're going to choose the regulars for the tournament now.

11:04.390 --> 11:05.260
What?

11:06.180 --> 11:09.020
The winner between you and me will become the regular.

11:09.020 --> 11:12.940
Even if we're not allowed to argue, Subarun can't complain if we settle this through basketball!

11:14.400 --> 11:17.360
Your basketball isn't even worth looking at.

11:19.400 --> 11:20.820
Don't mess with me!

11:20.570 --> 11:21.740
Calm down, Maho.

11:20.820 --> 11:21.990
Wait up!

11:21.740 --> 11:24.200
Oh~, violent pervert.

11:21.990 --> 11:24.200
Come back and settle this, Natsuhi!

11:25.490 --> 11:28.950
Strangely, they've been at odds for a while now.

11:28.950 --> 11:34.840
Ever since that match, Natsuhi has been blatantly ignoring Maho.

11:34.840 --> 11:40.470
If it's because he's frustrated about losing,
then it's weird that he's only targeting Maho.

11:40.470 --> 11:42.090
Did you say anything to Takenaka?

11:42.090 --> 11:43.720
I don't know!

11:43.720 --> 11:47.220
I argue with him a lot, so I might say a lot of things, but...

11:47.220 --> 11:48.930
This happens every time!

11:48.930 --> 11:50.310
What did he mean, "Not worth looking at"?!

11:50.310 --> 11:51.350
He's such an idiot!

11:53.810 --> 11:56.400
Saki, you've known both of them for a long time, right?

11:56.400 --> 11:57.610
Could you do something about it?

11:57.610 --> 12:00.360
I've thought about trying to help, but...

12:06.120 --> 12:07.620
We haven't been fighting.

12:08.040 --> 12:09.540
What are you so stubborn about?

12:09.540 --> 12:14.580
If it's something Maho did, I can talk to her about it for you.

12:14.580 --> 12:15.380
Shut up.

12:15.380 --> 12:16.670
Don't get in the way of my practice.

12:19.550 --> 12:21.920
...it turned out like that.

12:21.920 --> 12:23.760
I see.

12:36.810 --> 12:38.900
You want me to help you?

12:38.900 --> 12:44.820
I want us to think of a strategy to help Takenaka and Maho make up during this training camp.

12:44.820 --> 12:50.790
Of course I want the two of them to make up, but I'm not good at things like this.

12:50.790 --> 12:53.210
I don't think I'd be of much help...

12:53.210 --> 12:54.290
I see.

12:54.290 --> 12:55.750
I'm sorry.

12:55.750 --> 12:57.000
Don't worry about it.

12:57.000 --> 13:01.670
I just asked you because I felt most
comfortable talking to you about this.

13:03.510 --> 13:05.930
Sorry for saying something weird all of a sudden.

13:05.930 --> 13:07.680
I'll go ask Saki again.

13:07.680 --> 13:09.430
I'll do it!

13:09.430 --> 13:11.360
Although I'm not good at it,

13:11.360 --> 13:16.600
if Subaru-san says I'm the best for this job, I can't say no!

13:17.810 --> 13:18.900
Really?

13:18.900 --> 13:19.770
Thank you.

13:20.230 --> 13:22.570
I'm going to try my best!

13:22.570 --> 13:24.780
All right, let's have a strategy meeting right now.

13:24.780 --> 13:26.280
Let's do our best!

13:26.280 --> 13:27.740
Yeah...

13:27.740 --> 13:29.620
Plan A

13:32.740 --> 13:35.460
Geez, the two of you are way too strong!

13:35.460 --> 13:37.210
Yay, we won three times in a row!

13:37.210 --> 13:38.670
This is nothing.

13:38.670 --> 13:40.420
It's going well, right?

13:40.420 --> 13:42.710
I'm surprised you had a game console here.

13:42.710 --> 13:43.710
Miho-nee-

13:43.710 --> 13:46.550
Mihoshi-sensei told me to bring one, you see.

13:46.550 --> 13:49.430
I wasn't so sure about the idea of
playing games during a training camp.

13:49.430 --> 13:52.680
But it ended up being surprisingly useful.

13:53.770 --> 13:56.020
Maybe Miho-nee planned for this to happen from the start...

13:56.020 --> 13:58.100
No, I'm over-thinking it.

13:58.440 --> 14:00.360
Tomo, let's change over.

14:00.360 --> 14:01.940
Me?

14:01.940 --> 14:03.070
I can't.

14:03.070 --> 14:05.240
I hardly ever play games, so...

14:05.240 --> 14:07.320
Come and play, Mo-kan.

14:07.320 --> 14:09.160
I won't go easy on you, though.

14:09.160 --> 14:11.580
This feels pretty good.

14:13.870 --> 14:15.700
Huh, is that it?

14:15.700 --> 14:16.830
Did we win?

14:16.830 --> 14:18.710
With that, they've won five times in a row.

14:18.710 --> 14:20.080
On top of that, they never lost.

14:20.500 --> 14:22.380
You lousy...

14:22.380 --> 14:24.840
Isn't it your fault? You super lousy...

14:27.010 --> 14:28.260
You...

14:28.260 --> 14:29.090
...bastard!

14:29.090 --> 14:30.300
Hey, stop that!

14:30.300 --> 14:31.010
Stop it!

14:36.600 --> 14:37.600
Huh?

14:38.480 --> 14:40.060
I'm sorry.

14:40.060 --> 14:41.400
Don't worry.

14:41.400 --> 14:44.860
People get really fired up over video games, so that probably wasn't a good idea.

14:44.860 --> 14:46.530
All right, let's move on to the next plan.

14:46.530 --> 14:47.690
Yes!

14:48.280 --> 14:50.200
Plan B

14:55.410 --> 14:57.120
Um, pass.

14:57.660 --> 14:58.790
Oh~!

14:58.790 --> 15:00.870
Nothing but the five of hearts will work.

15:00.870 --> 15:01.670
Pass.

15:02.580 --> 15:03.540
Pass.

15:04.210 --> 15:05.550
I pass, too.

15:05.550 --> 15:07.420
Hasegawa-san, do you have any playable cards?

15:08.010 --> 15:10.510
No, I'll pass too.

15:10.510 --> 15:12.340
Who's going to stop it?

15:14.010 --> 15:15.560
Hey, what are you looking at?

15:15.560 --> 15:17.770
Hey, Natsuhi, you're going to stop it, right?

15:17.770 --> 15:19.310
I'm not gonna do that.

15:19.520 --> 15:20.440
You wanna fight?

15:20.440 --> 15:21.560
You bastard...

15:23.980 --> 15:25.900
Could you guys stop it already?

15:25.900 --> 15:27.570
Subaru-san!

15:32.280 --> 15:35.700
Plan C

15:38.120 --> 15:39.290
Yay~!

15:39.290 --> 15:40.540
I cut the carrot.

15:41.000 --> 15:41.960
Okay!

15:41.960 --> 15:43.250
Who's in charge of the onions?

15:46.170 --> 15:51.470
I'm sorry. My eyes sting so much that I'm not getting anywhere.

15:53.510 --> 15:57.100
Why do I have to do something like this?

15:57.100 --> 16:00.020
If you don't want to do it, then don't eat!

16:00.730 --> 16:05.190
First of all, you're just leaving us with a lot of unusable onions by cutting them like that, aren't you?

16:05.190 --> 16:06.610
What did you say?!

16:06.610 --> 16:07.980
You wanna fight?!

16:09.440 --> 16:11.150
You guys shouldn't fight!

16:11.150 --> 16:11.990
Oh~!

16:11.990 --> 16:13.820
This time, it's a vegetable battle.

16:14.910 --> 16:17.490
Geez, I'll go call Hasegawa-san.

16:18.370 --> 16:20.830
It doesn't seem to be going well.

16:20.830 --> 16:24.120
Apparently the two of them got along pretty well in the past.

16:24.120 --> 16:30.010
Saki told me secretly that their relationship
worsened after Maho started playing basketball.

16:30.010 --> 16:35.720
So what's irritating Takenaka is the fact that Maho is playing basketball?

16:38.260 --> 16:41.220
The reason might be me.

16:41.220 --> 16:45.100
Maho made the basketball club for me, so...

16:45.940 --> 16:47.270
Tomoka.

16:48.860 --> 16:49.820
Pinch.

16:50.980 --> 16:52.940
It's got nothing to do with that.

16:53.610 --> 16:55.740
This has nothing to do with you.

16:56.740 --> 16:59.330
Their argument is just between the two of them.

16:59.330 --> 17:01.330
Subaru-san...

17:05.330 --> 17:06.000
Tomo!

17:06.000 --> 17:07.170
Hasegawa-san!

17:08.170 --> 17:09.170
I'm sorry!

17:09.170 --> 17:10.840
It was so dark that I didn't realise...

17:12.050 --> 17:13.260
It's okay!

17:13.260 --> 17:17.220
I didn't hear anything. I didn't secretly take a photo with my mobile phone either, so don't worry.

17:17.220 --> 17:18.510
I'm really sorry.

17:18.510 --> 17:20.720
I didn't know that Tomoka and Hasegawa-san had that kind of relationship!

17:20.720 --> 17:22.470
I didn't think that you two had progressed this far...

17:21.970 --> 17:22.970
Hold on!

17:22.970 --> 17:26.730
I don't know what you've misconstrued, but you're thinking out loud.

17:28.610 --> 17:31.360
I got carried away...

17:36.990 --> 17:39.660
I was really surprised just then.

17:39.660 --> 17:42.580
Geez, I was the one who was surprised.

17:44.000 --> 17:45.460
Jyabo~!

17:45.460 --> 17:47.080
The curry was delicious, right?

17:47.080 --> 17:48.210
Yeah~!

17:48.210 --> 17:50.500
It's delicious when everyone makes it.

17:50.500 --> 17:53.590
Hey, Hina, don't splash the water around.

17:54.550 --> 17:56.930
Maho, you know...

17:56.930 --> 17:59.640
It's about Takenaka-kun.

17:59.640 --> 18:01.010
Oh~!

18:01.010 --> 18:05.180
I saw Takenaka and Onii-chan leaving just a while ago.

18:05.180 --> 18:06.850
With Subarun?

18:06.850 --> 18:09.770
They said they were going to the supermarket to buy some juice.

18:13.440 --> 18:15.360
Sorry for making you come along.

18:15.360 --> 18:17.110
It's okay. I had nothing to do anyway.

18:20.240 --> 18:23.330
There really is nothing around the school.

18:23.330 --> 18:24.290
Yeah.

18:25.040 --> 18:27.410
It would be good if there was a convenience store.

18:27.410 --> 18:28.710
Yeah.

18:32.840 --> 18:34.880
Hey, Takenaka.

18:34.880 --> 18:38.630
Why do you dislike the fact that Maho is playing basketball?

18:42.050 --> 18:45.060
You don't know anything, and that's why you can ask something like that.

18:45.060 --> 18:46.680
What don't I know, then?

18:46.680 --> 18:48.230
She'll quit.

18:48.230 --> 18:48.980
Quit?

18:49.850 --> 18:50.940
That's right!

18:50.940 --> 18:54.520
In the end, she will. Even basketball, Maho will just...

18:57.320 --> 19:01.160
No matter what Maho does, she
becomes good at it right away.

19:01.160 --> 19:06.160
She was so receptive to basketball; I was quite surprised at the start.

19:09.330 --> 19:11.120
She has a genius's potential.

19:11.120 --> 19:14.420
Be it gymnastics or skipping, she learns faster than anyone else.

19:15.460 --> 19:21.590
I didn't want to lose to her, so I trained frantically so I could do the same things as her.

19:22.300 --> 19:27.140
But by the time I finally managed to do it, she had already lost interest.

19:27.140 --> 19:30.480
And she would say, "Forget that; let's play hide-and-seek!"

19:31.810 --> 19:35.610
After she learns how to do something, she quickly loses interest.

19:35.610 --> 19:38.320
When it was gymnastics and skipping, it was fine.

19:38.320 --> 19:40.150
But if she does the same thing with basketball,

19:40.150 --> 19:41.530
I won't tolerate it.

19:41.990 --> 19:46.410
If she dumps basketball, I won't be able to forgive her anymore.

19:46.410 --> 19:49.200
I'll cut all ties with her before that happens.

19:50.660 --> 19:54.630
Are you trying to say that Maho will lose interest in basketball and quit?

19:55.090 --> 19:59.460
What does she know about basketball, besides how to score a few shots?

19:59.460 --> 20:04.260
She'll definitely say, "Oh, this is all there is to basketball", and quit again!

20:05.350 --> 20:07.680
Maho is that kind of person.

20:08.220 --> 20:09.390
You too-

20:10.480 --> 20:12.310
What is it?

20:15.650 --> 20:17.360
115.

20:23.700 --> 20:25.990
116.

20:29.160 --> 20:30.830
Maho...

20:30.830 --> 20:32.460
Shooting practice?

20:32.460 --> 20:33.750
At this hour?

20:33.750 --> 20:35.290
And by herself?

20:37.840 --> 20:39.880
118!

20:40.210 --> 20:42.420
I remember Tomoka saying something like this.

20:42.420 --> 20:46.010
Even on days when there's no practice, she still does this without exception.

20:46.010 --> 20:47.180
120!

20:47.180 --> 20:54.020
I think Maho isn't just working for herself, but for everyone in the girls' basketball club, too.

20:54.020 --> 20:55.100
121!

20:56.060 --> 20:58.110
She won't quit.

20:58.820 --> 21:00.940
Looks like she finally managed to reach it.

21:01.530 --> 21:03.610
Finally reached it?

21:04.070 --> 21:07.490
Not just playing around, but seriously doing something.

21:08.910 --> 21:11.120
124!

21:17.380 --> 21:23.510
It just happened that there wasn't a girls' basketball
club in school, so she got there a little later than you.

21:24.420 --> 21:26.300
I'm going to bed.

21:26.800 --> 21:30.050
Hey, do you still think Maho will quit?

21:31.220 --> 21:38.150
Even though Maho is like that, she can't stand monsters, and she hates dark places the most.

21:39.940 --> 21:41.320
Good night.

21:48.450 --> 21:50.200
130!

22:00.790 --> 22:03.340
I want to grow up quickly (Yes-!)

22:13.060 --> 22:14.390
Come on! Come on!

22:14.390 --> 22:17.140
If I'm small, if I stay small

22:17.140 --> 22:19.650
You say there's virtue in it.

22:19.650 --> 22:21.230
But that's a lie!

22:21.230 --> 22:22.320
You're just trying to console me, right?

22:22.610 --> 22:24.940
I want to grow up faster!

22:25.360 --> 22:28.030
Drink milk, drink soy milk

22:28.030 --> 22:30.740
You say that the shrimp there is good.

22:30.740 --> 22:32.120
Triple A

22:32.120 --> 22:33.990
I don't need any ratings

22:33.990 --> 22:36.000
I want to grow up faster!

22:36.000 --> 22:36.790
Dribble!

22:36.790 --> 22:37.460
Zig-zag

22:37.460 --> 22:38.120
Defence!

22:38.120 --> 22:39.000
Offence (Yep!)

22:39.000 --> 22:41.080
I want to shoot the ball

22:41.830 --> 22:49.130
I want to be praised soon... by you

22:49.680 --> 22:52.180
"Look here. Look here. It's going to end!"

22:52.180 --> 22:54.850
Jump! Jump!

22:55.140 --> 22:57.350
More and more and more

22:58.230 --> 23:03.060
When can I become an adult

23:03.060 --> 23:08.860
I'm growing! It's painful! The painful sores.

23:09.150 --> 23:13.660
However, I'll definitely show you that I can endure it

23:13.660 --> 23:20.870
Shake, Bounce, Touch, Aim for the goal!

23:21.250 --> 23:24.340
Ah! I want to grow up faster!

23:25.460 --> 23:26.880
Rally-ho!

23:26.880 --> 23:28.970
It's finally Maho-Maho's turn to shine!

23:28.970 --> 23:32.750
I'll show you how charming Maho-Maho is!

23:32.750 --> 23:33.910
There's no time for that?

23:33.910 --> 23:34.720
Why's that?!

23:34.720 --> 23:36.380
Can't you just let me talk a little longer?!

23:36.380 --> 23:38.690
Come on, you say something too, goat-san!

23:36.970 --> 23:40.020
Next Time:

23:36.970 --> 23:40.020
Metal Master
